  "statuteText": "669:50 Filing Nominations; Certificate of Regularity. –\n\nIn filing nominations with the town clerk, the presiding officer of the caucus shall certify that the caucus was called and conducted according to the provisions of this subdivision. If nominations are not accompanied by such certificate, they shall not be placed upon the official ballot."
